    "description": "The Blackshields Trait replaces the [Legiones Astartes] Trait. Only Units from the Legiones Astartes Army List that do not have a specific variant of the [Legiones Astartes] Trait (no Legion-specific Units) may be selected for a Detachment with the Blackshields Trait, and it may not include Models with another Legion Trait. Each Blackshields Primary Detachment may select two Oaths of Moment and each Allied Detachment one (the Oaths of Moment pick).",
